{"r0": "gid://shopify/Product/16104470348158", "t0": [{"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Three single-variety oils to taste side by side.</p><h4>In the box</h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Hojiblanca</strong>: round, slightly bitter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Arbosana</strong>: fruity and green.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Picual</strong>: more robust, with a peppery finish.</li>\n</ul><p>Each olive is harvested and pressed separately, with no blending. It's the best way to discover that not all olive oils taste the same.</p><h4>How to taste it</h4><p>A little of each oil in a small dish, a piece of bread, and compare. A gift that makes a change from wine.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8664f1968923b3e58a03a64535d942b3c88ded12b3c6788c2d7feb3f4bd6e8bd"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "meta_description", "value": "A box of three extra virgin olive oils from Andalusia to compare: Hojiblanca, Arbosana and Picual. A great gift idea. Shipped from Paris.", "translatableContentDigest": "b06f2e984166fe5267954fb1d3055223e1c2d61e2dc3461186411c9ce1a5a854"}], "r1": "gid://shopify/Product/16104474182014", "t1": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Ecological Arbequina Extra Virgin Olive Oil, 1 L", "translatableContentDigest": "7365d88fda1b1c676a54c0408bec6fe09b86b4ced48c25e6015a1095c3bd31be"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>An ecological Arbequina (certificado ecológico), in a large size for everyday cooking.</p><h4>The taste</h4><p>Mild and fruity, with notes of fresh almond and a hint of cut grass.</p><h4>How to use it</h4><p>Drizzled over vegetables, in salads, or for low-temperature cooking.</p><h4>At a glance</h4><ul>\n<li>Variety: Arbequina</li>\n<li>Ecological (certificado ecológico)</li>\n<li>Origin: Andalusia, Spain</li>\n<li>Early harvest, cold-pressed</li>\n<li>1 L bottle</li>\n</ul>", "translatableContentDigest": "bb6c49e880fed77dc32bf42dc01859c9305c14114a94d013b4370b9c52d34f1e"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "meta_description", "value": "Ecological Arbequina extra virgin olive oil, mild and fruity, in a 1 L bottle. Cold-pressed in Andalusia. Shipped from Paris.", "translatableContentDigest": "b1dd57b3bda405101f5c7732e95850cf13f67e055f9aed7031adec474c4dbf44"}], "r2": "gid://shopify/Collection/747176821118", "t2": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Home page", "translatableContentDigest": "9b87f4b2595358107b068c38c1d573df79daa3bcc33e69c195d05c165aa071b5"}], "r3": "gid://shopify/Collection/750857027966", "t3": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Olive oils", "translatableContentDigest": "6dd52773a526fa626da9bfd427b9db458fe6be7f16300b226267f7582c6f6598"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Our extra virgin olive oils come from Andalusia. Harvested early, cold-pressed and imported directly from Spain. Arbequina, a blend or a box of three varieties: enjoy them raw, on bread, vegetables or fish.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "9aad5f8405552b38ff36d28020a57236092a8adc6e5c00ddbdac4aa8ebe26b2b"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "meta_description", "value": "Extra virgin olive oils from Andalusia, harvested early and cold-pressed. Arbequina, Coupage and a tasting box. Shipped from Paris.", "translatableContentDigest": "830daaf1214f1119eac0f10e5b0254572516955a01112740c3b2df1218d761b1"}], "r4": "gid://shopify/Collection/753182933374", "t4": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Iberian hams", "translatableContentDigest": "b6f2cbe8f02f8fa39172136b5831084a6133cc9120398d781213f1c96b4e78bd"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Iberian jamones. Prices shown per kg for whole and boneless pieces. Sliced formats are sold per 100 g, according to the cutting method stated.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2eec7a07906b74fa93fe6246eef238348fcd99540ae0b452c94f4188c96dcc46"}], "r5": "gid://shopify/Collection/753182966142", "t5": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Iberian shoulders", "translatableContentDigest": "8f2b186a50ab9155425064b9c08bf2b46d133eb1b7ce0d5bd820431b2a632f28"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Iberian paletas. Prices shown per kg for whole and boneless pieces. Sliced formats are sold per 100 g where a price is available.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "30dedd1022a151a15446e29d16c0b59aa6c39c1b5f8b084f2a25038949f865c6"}], "r6": "gid://shopify/Collection/753182998910", "t6": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Iberian charcuterie", "translatableContentDigest": "5868ba6599344b4a2e493a91f26a4f1cb37d1f47acab790136aa9e97ae18e108"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Whole Iberian cured meats.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "9b11f36b5e0d94324dc04fa8acabada8624aa8f8ab9dd2092fc2e939c6422847"}], "r7": "gid://shopify/Collection/753408344446", "t7": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Olive oils", "translatableContentDigest": "88f6fce9dced24c202bd716498bd7c77d94a8f3b3492c8ba42c3ea6ee5853f40"}, {"locale": "en", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Andalusian extra virgin olive oils and tasting boxes, chosen directly from the producers.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2403035fa1dab587c62e9c856aa302d7d6c103531ecbec630774f658a04ffb7f"}], "r8": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309719422", "t8": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Home", "translatableContentDigest": "533161735639c51adb4623f3780b497601d7b82108e6f03f5b65b5dd4c89f616"}], "r9": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309784958", "t9": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Contact", "translatableContentDigest": "2b5c3d26721ae9c350cf3009318b626f0fc8a90b4a2ac0ca8099c05aa849282e"}], "r10": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309817726", "t10": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Search", "translatableContentDigest": "733d1c742675f53792b10c780b3584b2197101e56f892ca382c35133ca6dce55"}], "r11": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309850494", "t11": [{"locale": "en", "key": "title", "value": "Orders", "translatableContentDigest": "0e3118a24b9ff7bdffb66c7342f1ad65016394b6cc2db7abc9a93b184560b82c"}], "r12": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309883262", "t12": [{"locale": "